  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 13th level, the prodigy may use her adaptation ability to gain the benefits of three talents at the same time. She may select one talent as a free action, two talents as a swift action, or three talents as a move action. The prodigy may use one of the talents to meet a prerequisite of the second and third talents and use the second talent to meet a prerequisite of the third talent. Each individual talent selected counts toward the prodigy’s daily uses of adaptation.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/prodigy#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
